     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"direction:ltr;margin:0;padding:0;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black\">\r\nHello, <br>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"direction:ltr;margin:0;padding:0;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black\">\r\nGreat question—could you post a small subset of your current .txt file? Also, could you run the `warnings()` command after the error message and post the results?\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"direction:ltr;margin:0;padding:0;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black\">\r\nWith those two pieces of information, we should be able to help. <br>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"direction:ltr;margin:0;padding:0;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black\">\r\nBest, <br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"direction:ltr;margin:0;padding:0;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black\">\r\nNate <br>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"direction:ltr;margin:0;padding:0;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"direction:ltr;margin:0;padding:0;font-family:sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black\">\r\nSent by mobile phone</div>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"Calibri, sans-serif\" color=\"#000000\" style=\"font-size:11pt\"><b>From:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">hbayesd...@googlegroups.com</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">hbayesd...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt; on behalf of <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">annora...@gmail.com</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">annora...@gmail.com</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Monday, April 29, 2019 9:15:26 PM<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> hbayesdm-users<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> dbdm_prob_weight</font>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:21px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;font-size:14px\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:24px\">Dear Sir or Madam,</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:21px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;font-size:14px\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:24px\">       I am writing to inquire a question about the decision model named “</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:24px\"> <span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial\">dbdm_prob_weight”,\r\n which is about Description Based Decison Making Task, in the 46th pages of hBayesDM manual.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:21px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;font-size:14px\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:24px\">       According to the manual, the description based decision making task including two choices, and there are two </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:24px\">outcomes (higher\r\n value/lower value) of every choices. And in my study, the task also includes two choice, however, one of them is a certain choice.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:24px\">Specifically, there are a sure choice(100% win </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:24px\">¥10</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:24px\">)\r\n and a risky choice(for example, 1% win 1000), you can get more information from following table. So, as for the sure choice, there is only one outcomes. Could you give me some advices how should I assign the data in the “.txt” file?</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:21px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&quot;lucida Grande&quot;,Verdana,&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;;font-size:14px\">\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12pt;line-height:24px\"></span></p>\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"0\" style=\"width:540.0pt;border-collapse:collapse\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height:65.35pt\">\r\n<td width=\"720\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:540pt;border-top:1pt solid black;border-left-width:initial;border-left-style:none;border-bottom:1pt solid black;border-right-width:initial;border-right-style:none;padding:0.75pt 0.75pt 0cm;height:65.35pt\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:139.7pt;line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black\">              Set 1: Equal-EV sure-gain set</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:18.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:200%\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black\">Risky option (EV=\r\n</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#333333\">¥</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black\">10 vs. sure option\r\n of </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:#333333\">¥10,EV= ¥10</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;color:black\">)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:18.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height:30.95pt\">\r\n<td width=\"129\" style=\"width:97pt;border-top-width:initial;border-right-width:initial;border-left-